{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：13:20 2026-10-08 HKT</p>\n\n<p>九建發展的牛池灣「巨無霸」新盤33清水灣，今日首度開放3個示範單位予傳媒參觀，將於明日正式對外開放，最快下周先招標推出面積538方呎以上單位，料不少於73伙。</p>\n<p>九建市務及銷售部助理總經理陳淑芳指出，33清水灣自命名後已接獲約2,000宗查詢，已獲批預售樓花同意書及上載樓書，將先以招標形式推出面積538方呎以上單位，料不少於73伙，涵蓋部分3房及4房間隔，部署月內公布價單，價錢將參考九龍市區鐵路上蓋項目。</p>\n<h2>第2座18樓A室無改動連裝修示範單位：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d03744e219cfb15773483a975b7c56c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_1_00_32_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8707883ce97937cd8f769149c21d2100/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_1_00_32_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/865c958c2a0c7e0e4437a9918e71e466/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_1_00_36_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8fa3654c07eef81d1abbbd5788e8c3f2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_1_00_35_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63d9d90d3c8ce17db4dc97f394a33531/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_1_00_36_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5bae50bdcf26efa027eaa9f81ace9d7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_1_00_34_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d13af8f570ed351e5b648b86a026905/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_1_00_37_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9ca47adea184b21b78aa10be63dd67d8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_1_00_33_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8bb2e8a6f41156ac252e60cc03a0821a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_1_00_31_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<p>發展商今日率先開放3個示範單位，涵蓋2房及4房間隔。其中4房以第2座18樓A室為藍本搭建的無改動連裝修示範單位，面積1,039方呎，採4房1套連工作間套房間隔，設計師以富現代感配以奢華作設計風格，並用翡翠綠及金色為主調。單位坐擁 6.5米闊採橫廳設計，主人房、睡房與客廳及飯廳屬同一座向，面向東南，可飽覽都市景及遠眺維港。</p>\n<h2>第2座18樓D室經改動連裝修示範單位：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0bff891e025c313505a7f6224911ecb3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_12_58_41_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/244d8d38bebc62649774ca828065c2e1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_12_58_41_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/769bd7cd342e8422d9000e77da9793ab/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_12_58_45_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3625b8faf3ddad365c40d2b2cfeedc87/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_12_58_46_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2e4949eb1a4732f30e9d23e246db61d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_12_58_47_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f18b66ac0ad910c4f062c56e734d7622/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_12_58_43_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26166657d54136fc34eba8e47ca9ec70/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_12_58_40_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>第2座18樓D室無改動交樓標準示範單位：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e1a29b3a646cdf9f2d10f11a918b870b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_12_59_22_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2883aaf56fce7ded8e544fe5aee0c52e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_12_59_22_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a85276e8214c56c7fdaeeb78053fcebd/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_12_59_24_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ebc21d94c48b50472135779732cb926/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_12_59_26_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4eb6834e9c48c06b388150ef8865dc42/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_12_59_26_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/03e2ffe75ca0ec37da0ac3ad7da6846b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_12_59_24_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b0a990f50e21bdafaba3e4bb0d7c1af4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_12_59_22_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>同時亦開放一對連裝修及清水的2房連工作間單位，均以第2座18樓D室為藍本設計，面積507方呎，樓層與樓層高度約3.1米，空間感十足。兩間睡房享同一座向景觀，均設有窗台，將充沛自然光帶至室內，營造出極佳開揚感。全屋間隔方正，布局流暢，空間靈活多變，方便住戶按需要按個人喜好擺放家具。</p>\n<p>相關文章：九建牛池灣「巨無霸」項目命名33清水灣 搶閘登場短期應市 首期涉361伙</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T05:41:04.591097+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":635,"images":23,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}